# Build context for the stress-matrix harness image (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# The image COPYs only pyproject.toml and flow_sdk/ (see Dockerfile); sending the whole repo
# (~2.4 GB with ui/node_modules, .venv, build outputs) made the build outlast the test's setup budget.
*
!pyproject.toml
!flow_sdk
flow_sdk/rust/target
flow_sdk/rust/**/target
**/__pycache__
**/node_modules
**/*.pyc
